[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C02_WINTER]
Ponyville’s Winter

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C02_WINTER_desc]
With the Windigos interfering with the weather, the ponies of Ponyville are forced to deal with the harsh winter.
Unlike other areas of Equestria where terrible winter is accepted by the poor citizens, Ponyville citizens are promised with a warm and cozy winter.
Therefore, if not for the citizens of Ponyville, just for getting more votes in the next election, we have to keep enough residues from §Y$PRODUCTION_MATERIALS_LOGS$§! or §Y$PRODUCTION_MATERIALS_COAL$§! for fire to keep Ponyville warm.
Currently we have [?C02.VAR_C02_WINTER_FIRE_PRODUCED|Y0] total units of produced logs and coal. Based on the current weather, we need to keep at least [?C02.VAR_C02_WINTER_FIRE|Y0] total units of produced logs and coal, so that the residues are enough to keep Ponyville warm.
Otherwise, we will continue to lose stability, manpower and votes in the winter days.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C02_WINTER]
小马谷寒冬

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C02_WINTER_desc]
由于风之魔对天气的干扰，小马谷的小马们不得不应对严寒的冬天。
在其他地区那些阴冷的冬天已经被可怜的居民们所接受，小马谷不同，小马谷的居民们被承诺将度过一个温暖舒适的冬天。
因此，即使不为了小马谷的居民，哪怕是为了在下次选举中获得更多的选票，我们必须保证有足够的来自§Y$PRODUCTION_MATERIALS_LOGS$§!或§Y$PRODUCTION_MATERIALS_COAL$§!的残渣用于燃烧，以保持小马谷的温暖。
目前我们有总计[?C02.VAR_C02_WINTER_FIRE_PRODUCED|Y0]单位的木材和煤炭产出。根据当前的天气，我们需要至少保持[?C02.VAR_C02_WINTER_FIRE|Y0]单位的木材和煤炭产出，以确保残渣足够度过冬天。
否则，我们将在冬天继续失去稳定性、马力和选票。
